(O104 - Probe Outside Corner)
(Probes X and Y to find an outside corner, sets work offset)
(Requires: [PROBE] VEL, SEARCH_DIST, XY_CLEARANCE, Z_DROP in LinuxCNC INI)
(Usage: Position near corner, then call)

O104 sub

    #<probe_vel> = #<_ini[PROBE]VEL>
    #<search_dist> = #<_ini[PROBE]SEARCH_DIST>
    #<xy_clear> = #<_ini[PROBE]XY_CLEARANCE>
    #<z_drop> = #<_ini[PROBE]Z_DROP>
    #<probe_diam> = #<_ini[PROBE]DIAMETER>

    M5
    M9
    G90
    G40
    G49

    (Drop to probe height)
    G91
    G0 Z-#<z_drop>

    (Probe X- direction)
    G38.2 X-#<search_dist> F#<probe_vel>
    #<x1> = #5061
    G0 X#<xy_clear>

    (Probe Y- direction)
    G38.2 Y-#<search_dist> F#<probe_vel>
    #<y1> = #5062
    G0 Y#<xy_clear>

    (Retract Z)
    G0 Z#<z_drop>

    (Set work offsets, accounting for probe radius)
    (For outside corner: X = x1 + radius, Y = y1 + radius)
    #<radius> = [#<probe_diam> / 2.0]
    G10 L20 P0 X[#<x1> + #<radius>]
    G10 L20 P0 Y[#<y1> + #<radius>]

    G90

    (MSG, Outside corner set: X#<x1> Y#<y1>)

O104 endsub
M2
